      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11722324::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "An oxidizing atmosphere produces a Cr- and Al-rich oxide scale.",
      "field": "hypothesis; structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11722324::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Cr- and Al-rich oxide is localized primarily along grain boundaries.",
      "field": "hypothesis; structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Under oxidizing conditions, the Cr- and Al-rich scale is continuous and adherent.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The continuous oxide scale acts as a diffusion barrier that slows oxygen transport and further oxidation.",
      "field": "hypothesis; mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11722324::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Ti can introduce defects that compromise oxide-scale stability over time.",
      "field": "mechanism; uncertainty",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A reducing atmosphere produces a limited or discontinuous oxide scale.",
      "field": "hypothesis; mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Suppression or discontinuity of the scale in a reducing atmosphere permits increased oxygen ingress.",
      "field": "hypothesis; mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Increased oxygen ingress under reducing conditions accelerates near-surface degradation.",
      "field": "hypothesis; mechanism; predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The bulk FCC matrix remains initially intact during the proposed exposures.",
